{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2544","id":3975296837,"node_id":"PR_kwDOACGs6c7s8jdF","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2544","diff_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2544.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2544.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2544","number":2544,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: accept uppercase E exponent in negative number args","user":{"login":"spokodev","id":239690017,"node_id":"U_kgDODklhIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239690017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev","html_url":"https://github.com/spokodev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spokodev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Commander accepts unescaped negative numbers as command-arguments and as optional/variadic option-arguments (README: \"Negative numbers are special and are accepted as an option-argument\"). The negative-number detector matches only a lowercase `e` exponent, so a negative number written with an uppercase `E` (`-1E3`, `-1.2E-3`) is not recognised and is rejected as an unknown option, even though JavaScript parses `-1E3` and `-1e3` identically (`Number('-1E3') === -1000`).\n\n```js\nprogram.argument('<temp>');\nprogram.parse(['-1e3'], { from: 'user' }); // ok\nprogram.parse(['-1E3'], { from: 'user' }); // error: unknown option '-1E3'\n```\n\n## Cause\n\nIn `lib/command.js`, `negativeNumberArg` tests the arg against `/^-(\\d+|\\d*\\.\\d+)(e[+-]?\\d+)?$/`. The exponent group matches only lowercase `e`, so an uppercase-`E` negative fails the test, is then classified as an option, lands in the unknown list, and is reported by `unknownOption()`.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd the `i` flag to the pattern. The only letter in it is `e`, so the flag makes `E` and `e` both match and changes nothing else. Invalid inputs such as `-1X3`, `-0xFF` and `-1e3.0` stay rejected.\n\n## Testing\n\nExtended the existing parametrized `negativeNumbers` cases in `tests/negatives.test.js` with the uppercase-`E` forms. They fail on the current code (rejected as unknown option) and pass with the fix. The full suite stays green.\n","created_at":"2026-07-02T03:16:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T13:00:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T12:28:45Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T12:28:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"a6bcd2ec188dd684c11076ea74747b46eb32f44c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":1418520456,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE4NTIwNDU2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/labels/pending%20release","name":"pending release","color":"a7f9b6","default":false,"description":"Merged into a branch for a future release, but not released yet","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2544/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2544/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2544/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/statuses/b2e92c61d2045c99a7014924d60148a6e426ca82","head":{"label":"spokodev:fix/negative-number-uppercase-exponent","ref":"fix/negative-numbe